    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "refcell_title",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 195,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "RefCell<T>（运行时检查）\n\n- 违反借用规则 → panic!\n- borrow() / borrow_mut() 记账\n- 少量运行时开销，更灵活",
      "originalText": "RefCell<T>（运行时检查）\n\n- 违反借用规则 → panic!\n- borrow() / borrow_mut() 记账\n- 少量运行时开销，更灵活",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#7c2d12",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
