      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "panic_note",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "如果同时存在两个可变借用，运行时就会 panic：\nalready borrowed: BorrowMutError。这种“内部可变性”常与 Rc 组合使用（Rc<RefCell<T>>）。",
      "originalText": "如果同时存在两个可变借用，运行时就会 panic：\nalready borrowed: BorrowMutError。这种“内部可变性”常与 Rc 组合使用（Rc<RefCell<T>>）。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400001,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 400002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "summary",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 560,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "组合拳：Rc<RefCell<T>> = 共享所有权 + 内部可变性。\n同类还有 Cell<T>（Copy 类型）、RefCell<T>（非 Copy 类型）；多线程版本是 Arc<Mutex<T>>。",
      "originalText": "组合拳：Rc<RefCell<T>> = 共享所有权 + 内部可变性。\n同类还有 Cell<T>（Copy 类型）、RefCell<T>（非 Copy 类型）；多线程版本是 Arc<Mutex<T>>。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
